# Settings for Phygital Engram. Copy this file to .env next to the program, or set these in your terminal.
# Everything here is optional. Every setting is explained in docs/settings.md.
# The names come from the working version and may change before 0.1.0.
# Never put real values in this example file.

# ---- your notes ----
# The folder of Markdown notes to search. Phygital Engram only reads it.
# ENGRAM_VAULT=~/Notes

# ---- where its own files go ----
# The folder for the index. It must be OUTSIDE your notes folder, or it refuses to run.
# ENGRAM_DATA=~/.local/share/phygital-engram

# ---- note cards (optional) ----
# Your own AI key. Only used if you turn on note cards. Never share it, never commit it.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# ---- the connector for AI apps (optional) ----
# The path to engram.py, if it is not next to the mcp folder.
# PHYGITAL_ENGRAM_CLI=/path/to/phygital-engram/engram.py
